{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45231d9230c8cf21f6057955cbe58a02b139bc5e488d02e7ed61953c026349cc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f68c1cb77cf077cbd4d209db546510ea2c19f05c9d12fe2bb33b23498a9464f5",
      "text": "这份胸中的热意属于谁？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84e1faed66268d351bed30938fb95e46ba743fb804c92ec84d6b94e1174b4722",
      "text": "制作人正在事务所整理粉丝来信。\n与前来开会的北斗一起感受粉丝们传递的\n心意，北斗察觉到了自身的变化。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f68c1cb77cf077cbd4d209db546510ea2c19f05c9d12fe2bb33b23498a9464f5",
      "text": "这份胸中的热意属于谁？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcd1f27f7d9e318ae627c3df389e53db48d8cd3ad6c7e3b76a8dcd73ddadb4da",
      "text": "呼，收拾得差不多了。\n剩下的就只有把这些粉丝来信分类了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a1988ecb16799445adfd4562fd462e5ca555094b5cddebd81e688971e8e9520",
      "text": "Ciao☆●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c80047dfad9f74e08169e323507b3795ef05727636732557bf03e15fb12f305",
      "text": "哎呀？在收拾东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbdbaf16ba345ea714985c74072a3d840d2cdb69ee92bb5ed17d247f7b8a41c3",
      "text": "辛苦了，北斗先生。\n是的，我正在整理寄到事务所的包裹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3076d6b5776f503896cafb611fbf1700349f1fae7deb5108f9ff5b675ff1834e",
      "text": "开会之前我就会弄完的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afa492a4f0fe5dcd1b3f6eedaa837a61755a6d019dcd2d73c21e5e1c91574b4c",
      "text": "啊，是在给粉丝来信分类吗？\n能让我也看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abf9297fcf9ce097dc61141c812525b2b65827cd74e8367dfa1d6039bb0e7830",
      "text": "当然可以。这个箱子里的，\n全都是寄给Jupiter的信件哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42917e070f3a715946a7a313cdd75c7d23ec2664b2c14f0303336fe827536179",
      "text": "这么多……\n礼物也很多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d445404bf760e698142fce4e871d7159c8f416920add0f0e06c02b9be0d8e7ee",
      "text": "呵呵。光看包装，\n就能隐约猜出是送给谁的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:696ff12df7bf376093de7cf5f3530c7fb565a91c19ada2ee98881090fd159789",
      "text": "这份是冬马的，这份是给翔太的礼物。\n然后，这份大概是给我的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffef01b27f734a02a2a17d03eeddc0e0aac0ac6d9d47c60fbb506fe3ce7d8542",
      "text": "哇，全猜对了！\n不看收件人就能猜中，真厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f41d26f0949344a590775f128baf71c87823d6b1cbb448ccdfc43652838ac69",
      "text": "毕竟我很了解Jupiter嘛☆\n但是，我想粉丝们大概……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e7cdeab0dbf29f8b67573d5733791cb670ff7868061f02550ed060683e30dc",
      "text": "也和我一样深爱着、理解着Jupiter吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49947e29bb417ca3c1e3cc93023b8262e52c7a4173e63feaa1ad2551aaa998c2",
      "text": "这个箱子的沉重感，\n仿佛在诉说着粉丝们的这份心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c01728a59e90115aae0ee52be9914b7ac51368925900fb92d9fabb2487f5c6ee",
      "text": "真期待回家拆开它们啊☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ec916eadaa98c510f0a468321f13278222ad98bf60445315d2ce7319831e53f",
      "text": "北斗先生在当模特时期，\n应该就收到过很多粉丝来信了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41fca51969ba6f0a9d6849a41be1deca70db9f4eb3446cede74097562b358a83",
      "text": "是的。不过，\n现在的喜悦和那时又不太一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6962affeb9ab86f7e8ec052ed7e899f1e0378aa7259c0c97edc03aff15251b9",
      "text": "前几天我也收到了模特时期的粉丝寄来的信……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b81a0a306901a9d86b8bd5fa5da3d780e401693a714de7c5aee85a2537ffc83",
      "text": "上面写满了和过去一样，\n从未改变的鼓励话语。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc694004a6bc6975f40da100a2f6eb39ef1d87f308e8448ac60e2fe26d817c59",
      "text": "能被天使酱这么长久地、\n毫无保留地寄托着真挚的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a948b595422585285313481b33fb48b53158fead606ced98083ef4303a1f3a1",
      "text": "我真是个幸福的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa42f650b10e2b899cf73cbadc75f30b23680a9d361a2c2e8707058b5a7482f",
      "text": "而且成为偶像之后，\n收到天使君寄来的信也变多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cac943bc71b6bafc54f2e1427052186822870a6da53c0b0fb0e23b592a18a2de",
      "text": "天使君会寄来什么样的内容呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ade13a0f08b008792e943d26d602c8cdaa37fd8ae05a1f188b2fc2997201848d",
      "text": "是非常热烈的心意哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b94a9b5e0955fe522b222b1f76a850a10deb63ef2c721a674fc4080246b153",
      "text": "“被演唱会上的表现深深打动了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa9e4f4ec636edfa86e00f5f9d3f65985447c5591e347d115338e721336b07de",
      "text": "“北斗君是我的偶像！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dad9d893048eb9f943e440761847969a3c3e8e3be2b430f3c9a7d4f2f2c4efe6",
      "text": "虽然当模特时也有很多男性粉丝支持我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53188b997775ac45600556644c1a14016b77b755ab859dc80a6bc66c612d765d",
      "text": "但信里写的字字句句，\n总觉得饱含着更多热忱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:940f0861ace9af61c885465489b9cd782139489626f2ea4a0af7097ade460c49",
      "text": "或许是因为从冬马那里感染到的热忱，\n这次又传递到了大家身上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be23dbc5185180916b7a1eb034a690e2fb385711f22637b2d621f0734bf0daf8",
      "text": "一定是这样的。我也从北斗先生的舞台上，\n感受到了那份激情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:384f1522fd7feb55793a2ec59c70cbaa65d863ca4554d2c330f1939a4df1c24a",
      "text": "正因如此，才更想以制作人的身份贡献力量！\n我由衷地这么觉得。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cbd6225b2755d0faaddff0b20ec9a5fbfdc3ad1fce018d048ce67d454e0361d",
      "text": "能听到●●●●プロデューサー这么说，\n我很荣幸呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f8fe762807183d3b4bc0a1723dd3db6f898916a30774dad009535c77b183f30",
      "text": "呵呵。和你聊着聊着，\n明明不在舞台上却感觉要热血沸腾起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece17199ca8b7b0f06eada979b019d82d4ccbfb268dedfefbd650b1e5354a9cb",
      "text": "我也是，好像有点太激动了。\n真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:469a45a0aa1d94eadc6a1e64f7b466f89ba117297bb631b549703351fbf3f6da",
      "text": "啊，这份礼物是给北斗先生的呢。\n还附带了留言卡片哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e13143d1d6c2f217f0bdcea956ecfbf690428db0eadce6942bd3efb1b3e7dd7",
      "text": "“北斗先生是我的向往与目标。\n我会紧跟那令人信赖的背影！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28fe3f2d6cc64d0b91c2e02b9e13caa44b382cd0938451e347ad1470315d608b",
      "text": "“今后也期待您的活跃表现！”\n……这样写着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96cd593c2e287365d844ab5fc26ae5f0859cbd5cd8a1d4bcfc76a9699380b5ff",
      "text": "（……曾经迷失了目标的我，背影如今\n在某些人眼里居然也显得令人信赖了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000061:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f0b2832b96e6bfd5b648de79104bb4a00ef4a255cd7c9e7aeb643e5f2f1fd90",
      "text": "好，接下来只要把这个纸箱搬走……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3dc9fb646655a415d8b47219216ccddbed9c7d6f537ada274b4322482ea40d",
      "text": "嗯！？好沉啊，里面装了什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67d468a11f7f362e338c22f37261404d11213050f9feb9624733104638b9d897",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n让我来试试吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0e3a200fbeeb8ce70c0b2115ac21dccd2e9b82757b6bb502f8cb7bfc0bb75be",
      "text": "确实挺重的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f05660fed38aaf22b57b78f3f462c14d1573b145983b65f8bee7ac9f734aec05",
      "text": "里面的东西是……啊，\n好像是前阵子工作用过的样品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddf4c88758f1a2e68627e186a94463f1d2f08829e02c65a0305d6be21923aecc",
      "text": "北斗先生，力气真大啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0141dde1c4d47d3375ab45623fc4008f4de084f200346009952c312547fb4724",
      "text": "别看我这样，卧推可是能举起100公斤的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75c42bb01aad6e813b5d3aa3e7e5c671a52942ddd3a13d8c7c3e76e01d4e655d",
      "text": "而且俯卧撑也能做大概300次左右吧。\n臂力还算挺大的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b79effc9c2c765b6cca95117458f2b9d754dd6a5f674989a90c08c75d6857471",
      "text": "不介意的话，要不要我也把你抱起来试试？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:161773fe67e069b0a360dce2359d46c75e352feb82466bb2d6ee07d9aca1ea67",
      "text": "哎、不用了，这怎么好意思……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95af888f229f311908f94d6fc71316d83b08c6b2b859a8cacb47ae526b1ee39a",
      "text": "哎呀，真可惜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:649fa34781906d36051807682acf75532219bba16669738ebcbd472185d21e0b",
      "text": "嘛，差不多也快到开会的时间了，\n要是被冬马和翔太看到可就不得了了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3772141a3b8b901b592a2c273a2cd3730a73f900255d945abcbc4f569b25da6d",
      "text": "冬马肯定会跟我赌气，然后乱逞强呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
